Parts of engine/ are translated from the source code of Command & Conquer Generals
Zero Hour, (c) 2001-2003 Electronic Arts Inc., released by Electronic Arts under the
GNU GPL v3 with the additional terms reproduced below. Those parts keep the original
SAGE class and file names so they can be compared with their source:

  engine/src/Common/GameCommon.h, AsciiString.*, ArchiveFile*.h, ArchiveFileSystem.h
  engine/src/Common/System/ArchiveFile.cpp, ArchiveFileSystem.cpp
      <- GeneralsMD/Code/GameEngine/{Include,Source}/Common/...
  engine/src/GameEngineDevice/Win32Device/Common/Win32BIGFile*, Win32BIGFileSystem*
      <- GeneralsMD/Code/GameEngineDevice/.../Win32Device/Common/...
  engine/src/Libraries/WWVegas/WWLib/chunkio.*
  engine/src/Libraries/WWVegas/WWMath/matrix3d.h
  engine/src/Libraries/WWVegas/WW3D2/w3d_file.h, htree.*, hlod.*, meshmdl.h,
      meshmdlio.cpp, assetmgr.*
      <- GeneralsMD/Code/Libraries/Source/WWVegas/...

BFME-specific behaviour (5 Hz logic, BIG4 archives, archive load order) follows the
Open-BFME-1 decompilation (https://github.com/Open-BFME/Open-BFME-1); the citing
comments name the exact files.

